# Workspace-level. Each crate keeps its own .gitignore for crate-local rules.
/target/
# `retrograde` run notes: a local SQLite store. `retrograde notes export`
# is how a note reaches git, as results/<arm>/seed-<s>/notes.md.
/.retrograde/
.cargo/
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
__pycache__/
# Superpowers design docs are local working notes, never committed (user rule 2026-09-13).
/docs/superpowers/
